        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' field='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.FO (copy)_3663256143812112384:nk]' value='54' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='display-field-labels' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.FO (copy)_3663256143812112384:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>
In this tab, we examine the competitiveness score of the incentives against the percentage of incentivisation in cities. We expect a positive correlation between these variables in healthy setups.

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>only </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>CARC spend is included.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Competitiveness score</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> is a pre-mature index and thus it is a work in progress. It doesn&apos;t cover the maturity of a market or competitiveness to full extent. It aims to show a direction rather than a reliable scaled number.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- The data is limited to always last 60 days since this is how competitiveness score is calculated.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.FO (copy)_3663256143812112384:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
