    <worksheet name='Info Sheet.QS'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='incentives_high_level' name='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf'>
            <column caption='Notes.QS' datatype='string' name='[Notes.VP (copy)_4102427468861890564]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Please Hover Here for More Info&quot;' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Incentive Type' datatype='string' name='[incentive_type]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Notes.VP (copy)_4102427468861890564]' derivation='None' name='[none:Notes.VP (copy)_4102427468861890564:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[incentive_type]' derivation='None' name='[none:incentive_type:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]'>
            <groupfilter function='union' user:ui-domain='relevant' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate'>
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;amount&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;bxgy&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;delivery_fee&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;fixed_price&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;free_gift&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;multi_level&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;No Incentive&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;percentage&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;Stacked&quot;' />
            </groupfilter>
          </filter>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' field='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.VP (copy)_4102427468861890564:nk]' value='66' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='display-field-labels' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.VP (copy)_4102427468861890564:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>In this dashboard, we display characteristics of some of the unhealthy incentive usage. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>only </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>CARC incentives are included.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MOV</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> and </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MDV</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> examinations, Only-Vendor Funded or Only-Third Party Funded incentives are </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>excluded</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- We check if </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MOV </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>and </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MDV </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>rules exist for an incentive. We do not include the already existing </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MOV </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>clauses on orders.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Please keep in mind that blue lines include all incentives while orange lines include only DH incentives.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MOV (Minimum Order Value)</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>: It sets the minimum basket size before the incentive is applied. It is a relevant rule for amount (i.e. 3 euros off) incentives. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>MDV (Maximum DiscountValue)</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>: It sets the maximum discount applied by an incentive. It is a relevant rule for discount (i.e. %20 off) incentives.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>NCC: Non-Competitive Cities</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>. The definition is set by another team. It is believed that the spend on NCC should be minimal due to lacking competition.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- The definition of MOV, MDV and NCC might not be %100 accurate in a given order. This is due to myriad of reasons.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.VP (copy)_4102427468861890564:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{3E88EE0C-481D-4840-96F0-2F12AFFD5E91}' />
    </worksheet>
    <worksheet name='Info Sheet.QoA/QCT'>
