              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;No Incentive&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;percentage&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;Stacked&quot;' />
            </groupfilter>
          </filter>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' field='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_2773865573769142273:nk]' value='35' />
            <format attr='width' value='113' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='display-field-labels' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_2773865573769142273:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>PLEASE NOTE THAT THE VIEWS CAN BE EXPANDED BY USING THE + BUTTON AROUND &quot;INCENTIVISED?&quot; COLUMN.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>NOTE: PLEASE KEEP IN MIND THAT SELECTING &quot;WEEKLY&quot; MIGHT REDUCE THE PERFORMANCE AND THE VISIBILITY</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>In this tab, we aim to present the cohort performance before (and after) an acquisition or a QC trial at a given week or month. The performance can be analysed using different parameters.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, all incentives are included no matter if it is CARC or not.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- If there were multiple incentives used during an order then the channel will be called &apos;Multiple Channels&apos;.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Filters on </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>top</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> apply </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>all</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> 6 graphs. Filters to the</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'> left and right</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> will only apply to the 3 graphs</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'> each to the left or right</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Retention:</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> Customers who had an order / Cohort Size.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Frequency:</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> Orders from a Cohort / Cohort Size.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Activity:</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> Orders from a Cohort / Customers who had an order.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>QC Trial</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>: First order of an ACID that is not on a restaurant or courier vertical.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Since a </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>QC Trial</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> does not necessarily mean an acquisition, we can have orders before a QC trial and thus the return period is okay to be negative. For example, If Period -1&apos;s retention rate is lower than period 1 (and similarly -2, 2 etc.), we can say that QC Trial affected the retention positively.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- A </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>QC Trial</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> can only happen at one vertical, either Local Shops or Dmarts. We will not calculate a trial for first order in each vertical.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>Normally</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> we should </run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>not</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> see any activity before acquisition. For Talabat and MJAM, you might see Return Period go negative for Acquisition Cohorts. This is due to data issues: how ACIDs are defined. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='minwidth' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxwidth' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Calculation_2773865573769142273:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{14A9E5FB-A205-48A6-9177-24B07CEABEC0}' />
    </worksheet>
    <worksheet name='Info Sheet.VP'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='incentives_high_level' name='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf'>
            <column caption='Notes.VP' datatype='string' name='[Notes.QoA/QCT (copy) (copy) (copy)_2773865573769277444]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;Please Hover Here for More Info&quot;' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Incentive Type' datatype='string' name='[incentive_type]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Notes.QoA/QCT (copy) (copy) (copy)_2773865573769277444]' derivation='None' name='[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy) (copy) (copy)_2773865573769277444:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[incentive_type]' derivation='None' name='[none:incentive_type:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]'>
            <groupfilter function='union' user:ui-domain='relevant' user:ui-enumeration='inclusive' user:ui-marker='enumerate'>
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;amount&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;bxgy&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;delivery_fee&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;fixed_price&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;free_gift&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;multi_level&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;No Incentive&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;percentage&quot;' />
              <groupfilter function='member' level='[none:incentive_type:nk]' member='&quot;Stacked&quot;' />
            </groupfilter>
          </filter>
          <slices>
            <column>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:incentive_type:nk]</column>
          </slices>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' field='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy) (copy) (copy)_2773865573769277444:nk]' value='54' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='display-field-labels' scope='rows' value='false' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <color column='[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy) (copy) (copy)_2773865573769277444:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>PLEASE NOTE THAT THE TABLE CAN BE EXPANDED BY USING THE + BUTTON NEXT TO &quot;MANAGEMENT ENTITY&quot; and &quot;VOUCHER CODE&quot; COLUMNS.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>NOTE: PLEASE KEEP IN MIND THAT SELECTING &quot;WEEKLY&quot; MIGHT REDUCE THE PERFORMANCE AND THE VISIBILITY</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Introduction:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>In this tab, we would like to show the performance of a given voucher in a country. We&apos;ll focus only on the most used vouchers.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Assumptions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, all incentives are included no matter if it is CARC or not.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- In this dashboard, GMV values are split across stacked incentives based on their total (DH+VF) incentive amount</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Vouchers below are grouped under &quot;Others&quot; and Others are filtered out by default. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>   - do not have 50 orders a week or 200 orders a month, </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>   - are not within TOP20 in a given week OR a month.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Explanations:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>-</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>inCPGMV</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> (Incentive Cost per GMV): Incentive Cost will include all money spent on the channel while the GMV will be split between the stacked incentives as mentioned above.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>-</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>inCPO (</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>Incentive Cost per Order): Incentive Cost will include all money spent on the channel while the every order which the channel was utilised at least once will be included in the Orders calculations.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- (Voucher Only):</run>
                <run fontsize='9'> The metrics are calculated only for the voucher code that is shown on the left.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- (Whole Order): </run>
                <run fontsize='9'>The metric are calculated including the stacked vouchers on top of the voucher code that is shown on the left.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='11'>Known Issues:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontsize='9'>- Due to data quality issues, we can&apos;t identify which party paid for an incentive for every incentive. As a result All can be higher than the sum of DH + VF.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='9'>- Be mindful of data completeness. Please check the landing page or Incentives Data Availability and Quality dashboard for details.</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows>[federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf].[none:Notes.QoA/QCT (copy) (copy) (copy)_2773865573769277444:nk]</rows>
        <cols />
      </table>
      <simple-id uuid='{DA2E5550-0064-4CA6-BBF6-6C31ECC91112}' />
    </worksheet>
    <worksheet name='Share of DH Spend with Stacked Incentives'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>&lt;Sheet Name&gt;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='incentives_high_level' name='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf' />
            <datasource name='Parameters' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='Parameters'>
            <column alias='Monthly' caption='Analysis Frequency' datatype='string' name='[Parameter 6]' param-domain-type='list' role='measure' type='nominal' value='&quot;month&quot;'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;month&quot;' />
              <aliases>
                <alias key='&quot;day&quot;' value='Daily' />
                <alias key='&quot;month&quot;' value='Monthly' />
                <alias key='&quot;week&quot;' value='Weekly' />
              </aliases>
            </column>
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.06b8ia20c36l9e11i63851fqsdgf'>
            <column caption='Share of DH Spend on Orders w/ Incentive Stacking' datatype='real' default-format='p0.0%' name='[Calculation_4062176526552903688]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='(sum([DH funded  voucher with incentive stacking (copy)_4062176526548496385]) + sum([DH funded voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526550433797]))&#10;/ (sum([dh_contribution_eur]))' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Report Date' datatype='date' name='[Calculation_6152761569167699973]' role='dimension' type='ordinal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='DATE(DATETRUNC([Parameters].[Parameter 6],[created_date], &apos;monday&apos;))' />
            </column>
            <column caption='DH Vouchers (€) w/out Incentive Stacking' datatype='real' name='[DH funded  voucher (copy)_4062176526547972096]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IIF([is_stacked], 0, [dh_voucher_eur])' />
            </column>
            <column caption='DH Discounts (€) w/out Incentive Stacking' datatype='real' name='[DH funded  voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526549827588]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IIF([is_stacked], 0, [dh_discount_eur])' />
            </column>
            <column caption='DH Discounts (€) w/ Incentive Stacking' datatype='real' name='[DH funded  voucher with incentive stacking (copy)_4062176526548496385]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IIF([is_stacked], [dh_discount_eur], 0)' />
            </column>
            <column caption='DH Vouchers (€) w/ Incentive Stacking' datatype='real' name='[DH funded voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526550433797]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IIF([is_stacked], [dh_voucher_eur], 0)' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Created Date' datatype='date' name='[created_date]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
            <column caption='Dh Contribution Eur' datatype='real' name='[dh_contribution_eur]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Dh Discount Eur' datatype='real' name='[dh_discount_eur]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Dh Voucher Eur' datatype='real' name='[dh_voucher_eur]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Incentive Source Of Funding' datatype='string' name='[incentive_source_of_funding]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Incentive Type' datatype='string' name='[incentive_type]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Is Competitive City' datatype='boolean' name='[is_competitive_city]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Is Stacked' datatype='boolean' name='[is_stacked]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_6152761569167699973]' derivation='None' name='[none:Calculation_6152761569167699973:ok]' pivot='key' type='ordinal' />
            <column-instance column='[created_date]' derivation='None' name='[none:created_date:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[incentive_source_of_funding]' derivation='None' name='[none:incentive_source_of_funding:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[incentive_type]' derivation='None' name='[none:incentive_type:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[is_competitive_city]' derivation='None' name='[none:is_competitive_city:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[DH funded  voucher (copy)_4062176526547972096]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:DH funded  voucher (copy)_4062176526547972096:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[DH funded  voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526549827588]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:DH funded  voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526549827588:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[DH funded  voucher with incentive stacking (copy)_4062176526548496385]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:DH funded  voucher with incentive stacking (copy)_4062176526548496385:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[DH funded voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526550433797]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:DH funded voucher with incentive no stacking (copy)_4062176526550433797:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_4062176526552903688]' derivation='User' name='[usr:Calculation_4062176526552903688:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
