                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Tabs might have different datasets and different assumptions. As a result, it is important to check which incentives are included in every tab. Please check &quot;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>Please Hover Here for More Info</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>&quot; Boxes. They are mostly located to the lower right but sometimes can appear on the top of the dashboard.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Warning above will lead to having different values for &quot;Sum of All Incentives&quot; for a given entity and time period. This is due to having different data definitions. Please check the definitions before raising us any questions! :)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- We still do not have 100% trust in the incentives data. Thus, it is important to validate at least 90% readiness for the analysis period that you seek.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='11'>- Please bear in mind that, Customer Compensation (Auto/Manual) will not be a part of the CARC starting from 2022. This might create a decline in the spend starting from January, 2022.</run>
